35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It's worse than I thought. The car often comes back dirty or empty, and our weekly routines are the first things to fail.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,"Recording every run is a nightmare; it takes an hour a week! Plus, those heavy-use bursts create total chaos in our schedules.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The fixed costs are quite high, nearly 280,000 yen. More concerningly, the fuel spending is incredibly lopsided among us.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Other groups say asking for favors is what kills the mood. Also, checking each other's figures just makes everyone feel accused.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wow, the fuel is really uneven! And the diary shows we use the car way more on Saturdays than Tuesdays.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Servas, if the fuel is that uneven, a simple split isn't fair. But we also need to fix the handover state.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Takumi, if checking figures causes fights, we need a system that doesn't require us to police each other every week.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Misaki, I agree. The financial disparity is significant. We must find a way to account for this without creating resentment.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, exactly. If we keep ""untangling"" things, we're just going to keep arguing. We need a rule that's set in stone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, @Misaki, if some of us drive way more on weekends, maybe we should pay more? But I don't want anyone to feel bad!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, it's not about feeling bad, it's about the car being ready when you need it for those weekly trips.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"@Takumi, so a fixed system might be better than a flexible one if flexibility just means more arguing?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, May. The ""comfortable idea"" of a share being a share is currently masking a lot of unfairness.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"Yeah, the more we have to ""ask"" or ""check,"" the more we'll start hating the car.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I just want us to be friends! Let's find a way where the money is fair but the vibe stays happy!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
