67,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, honesty is good, but as Takumi noted, checking figures can lead to accusations. Option A avoids that friction entirely.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
